msgstr "该 README 中的机器人 launch 名是 `panthera_ht`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:18
#: 587026ad95154bb2985718cc43f454be
msgid "Clone and init"
msgstr "克隆与初始化"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:20
#: 10a5036113534936937c605a8be195ac
msgid "Field zip"
msgstr "现场 zip"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:22
#: 44102b4074764bee8a99ffcf8efb1d0d
msgid "README “quick deployment”: unzip (example `~/ht-deploy-ws`), then:"
msgstr "README「快速部署」：解压（示例 `~/ht-deploy-ws`），然后："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:24
#: 2694cc9a56b94d1b9dac8e5a8956f181
msgid ""
"cd ~/ht-deploy-ws\n"
"./release.sh --install\n"
"source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash\n"
"./quick_start.sh"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/ht-deploy-ws\n"
"./release.sh --install\n"
"source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash\n"
"./quick_start.sh"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:31
#: 2bb69545ac6048438c0b1ded0bd4f7aa
msgid "Git clone (development)"
msgstr "Git 克隆（开发）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:33
#: 94a697482d7547cbb55c5f046659fe90
msgid ""
"cd ~\n"
"git clone -b panthera-ht git@github.com:fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws.git "
"ht-deploy-ws\n"
"cd ~/ht-deploy-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh"
msgstr ""
"cd ~\n"
"git clone -b panthera-ht git@github.com:fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws.git "
"ht-deploy-ws\n"
"cd ~/ht-deploy-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:40
#: 7913c3574bf44171a064dc0c70fddf14
msgid "Then `source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash` and `./quick_start.sh` to build."
msgstr "然后 `source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash` 并运行 `./quick_start.sh` 进行编译。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:42
#: 19838d47d9fd4feeba80170bae346de2
msgid "Build and launch (scripts first)"
msgstr "编译与启动（脚本优先）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:44
#: 5ac4989fbca8426c8e77ccf26d7e193e
msgid ""
"cd ~/ht-deploy-ws\n"
"./quick_start.sh"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/ht-deploy-ws\n"
"./quick_start.sh"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:49
#: aeed84a8e6684764b618eb7883ca5b48
msgid ""
"README: **Build** (simulation vs real-hardware packages), then **Launch**"
" (single / dual arm, simulation or real). Real hardware uses serial "
"(`/dev/ttyACM*`); the script prompts for permissions."
msgstr ""
"README：**编译**（仿真 vs 真机软件包），然后 **启动**（单臂 / "
"双臂，仿真或真机）。真机使用串口（`/dev/ttyACM*`）；脚本会提示权限。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:51
#: fc9322ea1ded4c2ead3dd4d874414085
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Isomorphic teleop (同构遥操作) on this branch is `./teleop_start.sh` (master /"
" slave). See [Isomorphic Teleop](../7-isomorphic_teleop.md) and the same "
"README section on `teleop_start.sh`. Drag teaching (拖动遥操作) is **not** a "
"separate implemented stack."
msgstr ""
"该分支上的同构遥操作是 `./teleop_start.sh`（主 / 从）。见 [同构遥操作](7-isomorphic_teleop.md) "
"以及同一 README 中关于 `teleop_start.sh` 的章节。拖动示教（拖动遥操作）**不是** 另一套已实现的栈。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:53
#: a5eea5635f044070bc8180a4527d24d7
msgid "Optional README launch lines"
msgstr "README 中的可选 launch 行"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:55
#: e834b6e52f744f1f96f171ecda3106a1
msgid "Prefer the script. README equivalents:"
msgstr "优先用脚本。README 等价命令："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:57
#: ddf17128c4bd4c97a418eb0365be1847
msgid ""
"source ~/ht-deploy-ws/install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch manipulator.launch.py robot:=panthera_ht\n"
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch manipulator.launch.py robot:=panthera_ht "
"type:=dual\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=panthera_ht "
"type:=single hardware:=real\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=panthera_ht "
"type:=dual hardware:=real"
msgstr ""
"source ~/ht-deploy-ws/install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch manipulator.launch.py robot:=panthera_ht\n"
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch manipulator.launch.py robot:=panthera_ht "
"type:=dual\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=panthera_ht "
"type:=single hardware:=real\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=panthera_ht "
"type:=dual hardware:=real"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:65
#: faec3b86e07844b59021eea20c081834
msgid ""
"Zenoh: same as other deploy hosts — `ros-jazzy-rmw-zenoh-cpp` and "
"`RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_zenoh_cpp` (README)."
msgstr ""
"Zenoh：与其他部署主机相同 — `ros-jazzy-rmw-zenoh-cpp` 和 "
"`RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_zenoh_cpp`（README）。"

